      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu eahaweewa Musa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi fuga eaduupcheewi ghaydidi, siguuyeesi guurnooda humng'eeda, asikteawana Yesu, was giijasoocheanda ea ashoohoocheanda haw masaweagaasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niny ea doabiiwaat aba heeda dea ghayi ajeagu niny, gawuurji gidawooseata Musa doabiiwaat aba jeeda gheeda ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eara Yesu ea sinung' ghoah dea doabiiwaat muuchi biissa ea ghaambiidaat ea ghang'al Musa ak gawuurji siida deas gheeda gwandeawa mureeda ea ghang'al gheeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Aba gideaba giliwas gheeda gwanda siida deas, nea dea deas haleanjeeda sean ea ASEETA.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea Musa ea doabiiwaat aba haleanjeeda sean mida jeeda gheeda ASEETA nea gawuurji soomjeanda, ak gamuuwu haleanjeeda jea eergu galanya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea Gristo ea doabiiwaat aba jeeda gheeda ASEETA nea gawuurji baleanda. Ak geewooschi gheanyi iisiing'waanyi muuchi gidida sisikteawiin nea geaghwarji gidida sirarjiin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Fuufta fuga ASEETA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
